  "sentences": [
    {"text": "Thick, pristine snow blanketed the fields and smoothed every hedge into a soft white wall.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Large, feathery snowflakes drifted silently to the ground.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Thick, glittering hoar frost furred every twig.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Long, tapering icicles hung from the gutters like a row of glass daggers.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A bitter, biting wind howled across the moor.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Within an hour the blinding, swirling blizzard buried the road.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Fresh, powdery snow crunched beneath their boots.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A bleak, leaden sky pressed down on the hills.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Black, treacherous ice glazed the pavements.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "A deep, muffled silence settled over the garden, as if the snow had turned down the volume of the world.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The pale, wintry sun hung low in the sky and gave no warmth at all.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Bare, frozen branches creaked in the cold.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Their breath plumed in the frosty air.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The raw, penetrating cold numbed his fingers until he could no longer feel the key.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "The family huddled around the hearth, close to the warm, crackling fire.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "By afternoon grey, half-melted slush dripped from the eaves.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Shrieking, red-cheeked children hurtled down the hillside on sledges and tea trays.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "In the morning sun, the frozen lawn sparkled like crushed glass.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "Snow whirled past the window so thickly that the street lamp vanished.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The gale drove sleet into their faces like handfuls of gravel.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The stark, white fields stretched away without a single footprint.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Nobody came up the lane for a week, and the snow lay unbroken to the door.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The cold bit through his gloves and stung his ears.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "She shivered, and the chill seemed to come from inside the house.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Each snowflake that landed on her sleeve was a tiny, perfect star.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "A robin sang from the holly, bright as a spark against the snow.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Firelight flickered on the ceiling while the snow fell soundlessly outside.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The pond froze hard enough to walk on.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The lane thawed at midday and froze again by dusk.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Snowballs flew across the playground, and nobody went in when the bell rang.", "vibe": "Lively"}
